t%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d70ef63d96ae5d34e2599c05fdaec27e, https://si.imgix.net/1b53ceee/uploads/origins/142f9f7e-442b-4df9-aee0-84acd7f1efed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14ae33041dde764bf0b903d91bfb4275 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b53ceee/uploads/origins/142f9f7e-442b-4df9-aee0-84acd7f1efed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c38f3fd7f97e756334873e24cd9133b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "自作の太膨ラノベで出てくるうちの子（OC）のクロノシアの本体である肉塊姿をお願いします！\n外見に関しては自作のイラストはないのですが、竜人態や本体に近い細身の状態も含めデザインしてもらったものが多数ありますので同じくドライブから確認してください！\n構図に関しては肉顔の中心でも肉塊姿全身に別枠に肉顔でも構いません！\n\n以下のリンクは作中の設定になります。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/novel/series/11002020/glossary/251801\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/novel/series/11002020/glossary/264851\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DIlfm4lBeJGwOtD_fDBTkzrQqG12jlhR?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/78", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/346b0cfa/uploads/origins/6bbc9d85-ce5e-46bc-82be-f1bea7a0971c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec8e9ecedb3102c6ccc0470b83cd7dff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/346b0cfa/uploads/origins/6bbc9d85-ce5e-46bc-82be-f1bea7a0971c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec8e9ecedb3102c6ccc0470b83cd7dff, https://si.imgix.net/346b0cfa/uploads/origins/6bbc9d85-ce5e-46bc-82be-f1bea7a0971c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05460818d3a1ac8f29f2c745f8d922a6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/346b0cfa/uploads/origins/6bbc9d85-ce5e-46bc-82be-f1bea7a0971c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f0d68306f6ee40b621b61e7a1ae5bbc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "はじめまして！\n\nうちの子の肥育を描いていただきたく依頼いたしましたっ\n\n依頼したい内容なのですが\n魔法使いの子なので魔導書を使った魔法の暴発で、肉塊レベルに肥育してしまううちの子をお願いしたいです…！\n\nキャラ資料は以下になります\n\n■資料\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/ci6cbvgl1heeqen4jzrgy/.png?rlkey=qry7k4k8ctzryfp20hraeicg4&st=gujae7sl&dl=0\n\n以上です、何卒よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/77", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5b61298/uploads/origins/bfb39ba5-6c0e-4669-825f-449891110268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efe65436c2ba8898abf84392fe416ec1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a5b61298/uploads/origins/bfb39ba5-6c0e-4669-825f-449891110268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efe65436c2ba8898abf84392fe416ec1, https://si.imgix.net/a5b61298/uploads/origins/bfb39ba5-6c0e-4669-825f-449891110268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7ba959ab827d2d47d15e0e482bec747 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a5b61298/uploads/origins/bfb39ba5-6c0e-4669-825f-449891110268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6131502d999a53684c6be7466126bd6f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "コミッション依頼失礼します。\n版権キャラが大丈夫でしたらフルボッコヒーローズのチェシャ猫をURL先のイラストと同じくらいの太さでお願いします。\n立ち絵\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/e2fRKD3yHSQH61n8A\n資料用のツイート\nhttps://x.com/hiryu_seiruri/status/1875385884008403113?t=BjRCNQtde_iGhSbCX9sQeg&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/76", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9eb78353/uploads/origins/09124311-741e-479d-8e94-77c65875bf1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b41652daeeef0eab6944fc6d2707ea96", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9eb78353/uploads/origins/09124311-741e-479d-8e94-77c65875bf1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b41652daeeef0eab6944fc6d2707ea96, https://si.imgix.net/9eb78353/uploads/origins/09124311-741e-479d-8e94-77c65875bf1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4624eb0b31c5fbcf2be8f87f9600134e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9eb78353/uploads/origins/09124311-741e-479d-8e94-77c65875bf1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d5696e38b3e163c0e5c0705ca67989f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "うちのライズ・キルシェ・シュネの肉塊化をお願いします。\n顔の肉量を多めにしつつ、キャンバス全体にみっちみちな感じで仕上げて頂けると幸いです。\n\n以下キャラ資料\nhttps://x.com/Cosith/status/1538564612131409922?s=20\nhttps://x.com/Cosith/status/876855827688079360?s=20\nhttps://x.com/Cosith/status/1482835054862553091?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/75", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db18c72e/uploads/origins/c402a4eb-6f40-446f-9809-d0275718f5d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f16127c2f156c47c33671592fac3d06", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db18c72e/uploads/origins/c402a4eb-6f40-446f-9809-d0275718f5d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f16127c2f156c47c33671592fac3d06, https://si.imgix.net/db18c72e/uploads/origins/c402a4eb-6f40-446f-9809-d0275718f5d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b44bb33832fc4c015cc437666596c9c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db18c72e/uploads/origins/c402a4eb-6f40-446f-9809-d0275718f5d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d3142ca4fca06031a70e86752e601e6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I’m very interested in another art piece from you! This time it would be very fun to see these two characters, usually known for being incredibly fast and speed oriented becoming almost too fat to move! \n\nThey would still be attempting to compete in a race despite their weight, their bodies very soft to the touch! \n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/wtz959gorpmc6ze9saqvx/ANv3AzkIJmltSLDP1NuSSxM?rlkey=wxdi89ybvuz4txeey7bnidmv1&st=5izxkk2x&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/74", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.ne