orks/125748083", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/67", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f2c12ef/uploads/origins/6e4885f5-c706-435a-b54d-bad9d15c64cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=121888363c4d3a94bf361724a42d3bd7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f2c12ef/uploads/origins/6e4885f5-c706-435a-b54d-bad9d15c64cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=121888363c4d3a94bf361724a42d3bd7, https://si.imgix.net/7f2c12ef/uploads/origins/6e4885f5-c706-435a-b54d-bad9d15c64cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=490885bc06b5a2409c0559b7a42c4599 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f2c12ef/uploads/origins/6e4885f5-c706-435a-b54d-bad9d15c64cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a12247c0ce0c479f366d4dd786143b99 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello once again!\n\nIf it is possible I would love to see this large character drawn super huge, floating in a vast digital space looking embarrassed he has become so large. It would be very cute too see a close up of his face to show his large cheeks and embarrassed expression, featuring his two smaller ancestors next to him looking concerned and surprised at his immense size! \n\nA Size reference has been included to show how large I would like to see him drawn, the size of the other two is up to you, they can either be drawn skinny or chubby. Thank you very much for your consideration as always!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/jiyg4pppcasx0nrr47dxq/ALC8evkoxnE5vIDdhAm-ayc?rlkey=l1jt9cnn8mgpmd276rb8k29a5&st=8w2bfocc&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/66", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3e1dc590/uploads/origins/7f5ec754-7488-4aa7-baec-c7f86ff00009?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69410946832d65578fbc0c307a0f618f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3e1dc590/uploads/origins/7f5ec754-7488-4aa7-baec-c7f86ff00009?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69410946832d65578fbc0c307a0f618f, https://si.imgix.net/3e1dc590/uploads/origins/7f5ec754-7488-4aa7-baec-c7f86ff00009?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22d1a4f26dee19f27eb52f97871de688 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3e1dc590/uploads/origins/7f5ec754-7488-4aa7-baec-c7f86ff00009?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a190de2e9d431a808e8b6d3a0d1dbd5a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品、特にキャラクターが大きくて太いところが大好きです。\n\n私のドラゴンを、海の中の風景の上にそびえ立つ巨大な大陸サイズの塊として描きたいんだ。巨大な体と格闘している顔のアップも入れて。\n\n参考：https://imgur.com/a/sAPZdUc", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/65", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ad4b436/uploads/origins/82852f2d-17f4-4d06-9f1d-e44d0191c995?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bf513f90fb8a01a37164e886930d340", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ad4b436/uploads/origins/82852f2d-17f4-4d06-9f1d-e44d0191c995?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bf513f90fb8a01a37164e886930d340, https://si.imgix.net/7ad4b436/uploads/origins/82852f2d-17f4-4d06-9f1d-e44d0191c995?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82d23c952133fb1f244134cc5f6077c9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ad4b436/uploads/origins/82852f2d-17f4-4d06-9f1d-e44d0191c995?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5f5d60230856fcdaee9e880ffef7584 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\nブラックドラゴンのデビルンに大量の空気を与えて、お腹を風船のように大きく膨らんだ姿を描いて欲しいです。細かい構図等はお任せします。  \nお手数ですが、宜しくお願いします。  \n\n参考資料 \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lIqliMxlO0jZ0LO6XUmzujgF3_6NG5bW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/64", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/edb76e48/uploads/origins/85a812cc-3f42-4765-863a-2f3e7953265b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb4620718006a304a1b3dc6445fde022", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/edb76e48/uploads/origins/85a812cc-3f42-4765-863a-2f3e7953265b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb4620718006a304a1b3dc6445fde022, https://si.imgix.net/edb76e48/uploads/origins/85a812cc-3f42-4765-863a-2f3e7953265b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe0599c8076351b596e5a8be39e1d650 2x, https://si.imgix.net/edb76e48/uploads/origins/85a812cc-3f42-4765-863a-2f3e7953265b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f99333a505c41acd660dfd49a5ea7892 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "レイに餌をやるキルストが見たい。キルストはふっくらしている。レイは山より太っている！レイもリボンを使ってキルストに食べさせようとしている。2人ともドーナツを食べさせ合っている。  レイのすべてが見えるように、遠景と近景の両方があるはずだ。\n\nこれはキルストの参考資料。https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OiC-ngd0bcPgx7t_b12V2YvxX-8ZQ6g7/view?usp=drivesdk これはレイの参考シート。https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uIOm5DhpL1RfgmDSOmo2z0K-qH9XOYGA/view?usp=drivesdk レイは以前にも描いていただいているので、また描いていただけるのがとても楽しみです！リクエストを募集していただき、本当にありがとうございました。翻訳ミスがあり、リクエストが重複してしまい申し訳ございませんでした。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/63", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c40b025/uploads/origins/91bbc76f-5ce9-427a-9a03-eb818243a11c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37cb9b62138a2db143693290b10c3b74", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c40b025/uploads/origins/91bbc76f-5ce9-427a-9a03-eb818243a11c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37cb9b62138a2db143693290b10c3b74, https://si.imgix.net/1c40b025/uploads/origins/91bbc76f-5ce9-427a-9a03-eb818243a11c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb15d83528b0d824d3eee8e971fe509d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c40b025/uploads/origins/91bbc76f-5ce9-427a-9a03-eb818243a11c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92a245e5fcb93537783c3461d93f5365 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "オセアナは波を起こそうと海に飛び込むだろうが、津波を引き起こす可能性の方が高いだろう。XD\nオセアナは、自分が引き起こす災難に気づくことなく、楽しむだろう。\n\n強制ではないが、すでに海に入ってパニックになるシリオルがいるかもしれない。\n\n参考：https://www.deviantart.com/quakee/gallery?q=oceana\n\nサイズ : https://www.deviantart.com/quakee/art/Oceana-Try-New-Size-934147126", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/62", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/132c190a/uploads/origins/f999e9f8-a23d-4f1c-941b-5e817ae2706c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a20b3128724817002ccc24f60466ef0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/132c190a/uploads/origins/f999e9f8-a23d-4f1c-941b-5e817ae2706c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a20b3128724817002ccc24f60466ef0, https://si.imgix.net/132c190a/uploads/origins/f999e9f8-a23d-4f1c-941b-5e817ae2706c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76ba408be06a1572ce1a15dbc90f779f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/132c190a/uploads/origins/f999e9f8-a23d-4f1c-941b-5e817ae2706c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59f2bbc577ce1295955681bd70a4be78 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "コミッション依頼失礼します。\n版権キャラが大丈夫でしたらフルボッコヒーローズのアポピスをURL先のイラストと同じくらいの太さでお願いします。\n立ち絵\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/ihugo6sNECgXutK59\n資料用のツイート\nhttps://x.com/hiryu_seiruri/status/1656189539906629633", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/61", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d008ea16/uploads/origins/0c28d377-1c25-439a-8fce-2185c5eafc53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08d2b380c1994cc745434c3d4a7b40a1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d008ea16/uploads/origins/0c28d377-1c25-439a-8fce-2185c5eafc53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&c