d_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/59", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/03c2b7d8/uploads/origins/eb2f6fd4-5410-41fa-8d55-00448a4e290e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ca3a3e1ef9210c44ea7aee13d70471d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03c2b7d8/uploads/origins/eb2f6fd4-5410-41fa-8d55-00448a4e290e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ca3a3e1ef9210c44ea7aee13d70471d, https://si.imgix.net/03c2b7d8/uploads/origins/eb2f6fd4-5410-41fa-8d55-00448a4e290e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45e4b36671d74f1b686a204f15592520 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03c2b7d8/uploads/origins/eb2f6fd4-5410-41fa-8d55-00448a4e290e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=943fddfc2f6de9797fbcbc61a6b64d28 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nオープンしているのを見て、とても興奮しています！\n\n私のバードドラゴンの写真をお願いできますか？同じ写真で顔のアップもお願いします。彼の表情は嬉しそうで楽しそうです。\n\n以下は私の参考資料です https://drive.proton.me/urls/69YJJ90Z0M#EQiHMDN8W3LQ\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.proton.me/urls/69YJJ90Z0M#EQiHMDN8W3LQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6aba9db1/uploads/origins/3ee538c3-fcaf-41f9-a81c-6c209399ca78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1718ebd7b662ad61d1a6af99e36cbd98", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6aba9db1/uploads/origins/3ee538c3-fcaf-41f9-a81c-6c209399ca78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1718ebd7b662ad61d1a6af99e36cbd98, https://si.imgix.net/6aba9db1/uploads/origins/3ee538c3-fcaf-41f9-a81c-6c209399ca78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8bf49a61b4aa56db1f957bd3dfafdbd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6aba9db1/uploads/origins/3ee538c3-fcaf-41f9-a81c-6c209399ca78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ba1724d73a9ebba8a7705198878e07d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "안녕하세요. 이번에 오픈되었다고 해서 신청하게 되었습니다\n\n제가 신청할 내용은요.\n내가 보낸 두 개의 링크를 보면 구글 드라이브 링크는 범고래 캐릭터가 나오고, 드롭박스 링크는 나만의 디아루가가 나옵니다.\n구글 드라이브가 꽉 차서, 디아루가를 드롭박스로 중얼거렸습니다\n범고래 캐릭터와 디아루가를 당신의 그림체로 보고 싶습니다.\n체형은 당신의 작품 속에서\n(https://skeb.jp/@hiryu_seiruri/works/53)\n이 정도 크기로 하고 싶어요.\n범고래와 디아루가가 음식을 많이 먹는 대결을 해서 은하계만큼 살이 찌게 됐으면 좋겠어요.\n표정은 행복한 표정으로 했으면 좋겠어요.\n두 캐릭터 모두 얼굴을 클로즈업 해주시면 좋을 것 같아요.\n\n\n여기까지 제가 신청할 내용이었습니다.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/yce97m5bnyyp9cgjpnqd5/AEy1YICevWAcCAgW0BZ2KWI?rlkey=hex9eg6sy73mztlscgmm3x7oz&dl=0\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fJFufIBVbVu1n4e3FVgHrMxgc2v8wpeq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/57", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/73dff370/uploads/origins/079fa87b-8176-4683-9ab6-a5f919488141?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fdeb2a7f845fa467a58455b7b8caddc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73dff370/uploads/origins/079fa87b-8176-4683-9ab6-a5f919488141?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fdeb2a7f845fa467a58455b7b8caddc, https://si.imgix.net/73dff370/uploads/origins/079fa87b-8176-4683-9ab6-a5f919488141?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=890feb9a08c415f895a9263aed2f5c75 2x, https://si.imgix.net/73dff370/uploads/origins/079fa87b-8176-4683-9ab6-a5f919488141?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=daed8d8c833f81ebddcc206f7a791c1e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私のフレアオンキャラクター、ブレイズを描いても構いません。私は彼女が彼女に比べれば宇宙が小さいほど大きくなって、彼女がそれを喜んでいるのを見たいです。\n\nhttps://d.furaffinity.net/art/triggerthechu/1699454563/1699454563.triggerthechu_blaise_sfw.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/56", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eef122fa/uploads/origins/f4a63ee9-8d3f-4741-b60d-e8574ecdf296?bg=%23fff&