4693789484da 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "肉塊シリオル様に\n私よりもはるかに大きい生き物っているのね\nと言われる宇宙が何個も入りそうなサイズなアイが見たいです…！\nシリオル様の顔元のデフォ体型のジヴォイド皇帝はすぐ超えられるだろうと確信している様子でお願いします…！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/firstflash0202/status/1723288558927241597?t=KiaREfqzKXOiRXIjTUKcRw&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/54", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5b3459e/uploads/origins/a945d2ca-84ee-4371-a0fe-aacb07068622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab1bc1ce5729de6bf684826610d80cc8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a5b3459e/uploads/origins/a945d2ca-84ee-4371-a0fe-aacb07068622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab1bc1ce5729de6bf684826610d80cc8, https://si.imgix.net/a5b3459e/uploads/origins/a945d2ca-84ee-4371-a0fe-aacb07068622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8fa2fee90fa8ce9a799a6b8e6fca72e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a5b3459e/uploads/origins/a945d2ca-84ee-4371-a0fe-aacb07068622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0a196eeca5d54d59c4dffb725c7034e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I am very interested in another commission! \nI would love to see you draw my two digital characters, the blue one eating a lot and the red one embarrassed at how much weight the two of them are putting on, with him being a little bigger.\nIt would be very cute to see a background of some kind, it is up to you! I love your cities! \n\nIn the reference folder I have included some of your art as the reference for how fat I would like to see them. \n\nI hope you have fun with it, I love to see my characters drawn by you! ^^\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/ujruowbqvhnagh8m1upmx/h?rlkey=ex0lakiralu35v1k4143ogflg&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/53", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/097b1fb3/uploads/origins/f45083da-8128-460e-be5c-167543aa6cfd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f294cda931c9bf87e6632c63369a8737", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/097b1fb3/uploads/origins/f45083da-8128-460e-be5c-167543aa6cfd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f294cda931c9bf87e6632c63369a8737, https://si.imgix.net/097b1fb3/uploads/origins/f45083da-8128-460e-be5c-167543aa6cfd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b89b382fddb2af7c9b75519c24cffa7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/097b1fb3/uploads/origins/f45083da-8128-460e-be5c-167543aa6cfd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=046691bdb1891abf0bbfe7101d7919db 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。何年も前からあなたの絵の大ファンです。僕のキャラクター、チュー・ツインズ、トリガーとリグズリーを描いてもらえると嬉しいな。\n\nhttps://d.furaffinity.net/art/triggerthechu/1695085477/1695085477.triggerthechu_new_trigger_ref_sheet.png\n\nhttps://d.furaffinity.net/art/triggerthechu/1695092714/1695086390.triggerthechu_new_riggsly_ref_sheet.png\n\n二人の兄弟が宇宙を背景に宇宙全体を埋め尽くすというアイデアが好きだ。大きいサイズが本当に好き。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiryu_seiruri/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a27aa0c/uploads/origins/c38f1c59-a7ab-4a70-84a3-111575274311?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3bcc9b94ac583bf2a64f10220c60469", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a27aa0c/uploads/origins/c38f1c59-a7ab-4a70-84a3-111575274311?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3bcc9b94ac583bf2a64f10220c60469, https://si.imgix.net/5a27aa0c/uploads/origins/c38f1c59-a7ab-4a70-84a3-111575274311?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b9a277605471400378232dd11bc6f7b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a27aa0c/uploads/origins/c38f1c59-a7ab-4a70-84a3-111575274311?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0635a91638463030edaeb842a2264e0a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "密集宇宙に適応してるアイが見たいです…！\n惑星破壊アネイル先生のイラストみたいな超弩級乳で\n三角かつ湾曲してるヒュージサポーターを被せてビキニを付けてオシャレしてるように見せてる感じでお願いします！\nもしよろしければその後ろの宇宙の暗さの中に某皇后さまと思しき黄金色の肌がキャンパスいっぱいに広がってる感じだと…！\nhttps://x.com/firstflash0202/status/1605143706515881984?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}